    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Viktor’s Login Probe Protection adds a signed token to each supported login form. A login request is accepted only when its token is valid, has not expired, and has not already been used.</p>\n<p>The plugin protects the standard WordPress login form, forms rendered with <code>wp_login_form()</code>, and WooCommerce customer login forms. Tokens expire after 10 minutes.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Lower minimum PHP requirement to 7.4.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Protects WordPress and WooCommerce login forms with signed, expiring, single-use tokens.",
    "description": "<p>Viktor’s Login Probe Protection adds a signed token to each supported login form. A login request is accepted only when its token is valid, has not expired, and has not already been used.</p>\n<p>The plugin protects the standard WordPress login form, forms rendered with <code>wp_login_form()</code>, and WooCommerce customer login forms. Tokens expire after 10 minutes.</p>\n",
